WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.737
Noah Sanders.
Here for the job interview.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.472
Please take a seat.
Mr. Weinstein will see you next.

00:00:06.505 --> 00:00:09.475
[lounge music]

00:00:09.508 --> 00:00:17.450
♪ ♪

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.190
Job interviews, huh?

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:27.560
Never fun.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:29.429
Okay, just...

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.831
I get it.
Stay focused.

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.266
Cool.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.768
Cool, cool, cool, cool,
cool, cool, cool, cool.

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:36.769
[clicks tongue]

00:00:36.802 --> 00:00:39.639
[laughter]

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:40.640
Oh.

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.576
- Yeah.
- Whoo-hoo!

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:47.513
That was a big laugh.

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.382
[exhales]

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:50.450
(Weinstein)
Oh, no!

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.751
- I did it!
- No, you didn't!

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:55.321
- I did it.
- [laughter]

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:57.757
Jeez.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.326
Is this a job interview
or<i> The Carol Burnett Show?</i>

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:03.162
- You know what I mean?
- [laughter]

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:04.464
Oh, sir, sir, sir.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:07.100
- Oh, my God, that is too rich.
- Oh, well.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.768
Thanks so much
for coming in, Adam.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:09.836
Of course,
and you better stay away

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:10.870
from that Chinese food there.

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:11.871
Oh, my God,
you got that right.

00:01:11.904 --> 00:01:13.372
That's done--it's done a number
on my stomach.

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:15.875
- [martial arts shouts]
- [grunting]

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.143
Here's your fortune.

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:18.177
You're gonna be sick
in a half hour.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.113
[laughter]

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:24.750
Oh, my gosh,
what an absolute delight, Adam.

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:26.285
It's been great, and--can I
tell you something real quick?

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:27.520
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:27.553 --> 00:01:29.155
I don't even care
if I get this job

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:31.791
because I know
I've made a friend for life.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.793
What a terrific attitude.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:35.428
What a great goddamn attitude.

00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:36.629
Yup.

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.498
You son of a gun.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.200
You know what?

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:42.835
Right quick, before you leave,
I want to give you something.

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.370
No, sir,
I can't take any more gifts.

00:01:44.403 --> 00:01:48.274
This whole thing
has been a gift.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:49.909
My brother passed away.

00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:52.211
[somber music]

00:01:52.244 --> 00:01:53.212
21 years ago.

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:54.413
Wow.

00:01:54.446 --> 00:01:56.549
We were estranged,

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:59.519
and he became ill,

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:02.488
and he gave this to me
as a peace offering.

00:02:02.521 --> 00:02:04.323
Ohh.

00:02:04.356 --> 00:02:06.259
And then one day
when we were on the ocean,

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.694
he fell overboard on a boat
very much like this one

00:02:08.727 --> 00:02:10.930
and died.

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:12.665
I saw him struggling
all the way

00:02:12.698 --> 00:02:14.700
as a riptide
just pulled him down.

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:16.903
That bitch ocean.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.905
Would you please accept this
as a--as a token

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:22.842
of my gratitude for you
bringing joy back into my life?

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:26.879
Under any other circumstance,
I would refuse,

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:29.382
but I will accept
this gift today

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:31.751
because I know
how much it means to you.

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:33.920
So I will.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:37.456
Thank you.

00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:39.692
Ahoy, matey.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.627
[both laugh]

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.864
Ahoy, matey.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:48.401
[laughter]

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.802
How is that funny?

00:02:49.835 --> 00:02:51.837
Bernadette.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.873 line:92%
Bernadette.

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:56.209
- Are you hearing any of this?
- Oh, my God.

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.544
This guy. How do you keep
a straight face all day?

00:02:58.577 --> 00:03:00.846
[laughter]

00:03:00.879 --> 00:03:02.949
She's--isn't she sweet?

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.217
Sweeter than pie.
Sweeter than pie.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.151
Oh, my God.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:07.520
God damn it,
I love your fucking energy.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:10.223
Well,
what can I say, sir?

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:11.224
I am solar powered.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:14.194
[screaming laughter]

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:21.301
[continues laughing]

00:03:23.802 --> 00:03:24.971
Really?

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:26.939
You like--
you like that one, huh?

00:03:26.972 --> 00:03:28.741
Oh, thanks so much, Adam.

00:03:28.774 --> 00:03:31.611
Terrific.
[laughs]

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:35.748
Best interview I've ever been
a part of in my entire life.

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:37.250
Okay, who's next?

00:03:40.286 --> 00:03:41.454
You? Ready?
Let's go. Chop-chop.

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.890
Here we go.
[clapping]

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:48.594
Come on, let's go.

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:49.662
Okay.

00:03:49.695 --> 00:03:51.530
Hoo-hoo!

00:03:51.563 --> 00:03:52.932
Hoo!

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:55.501
Requesting permission
to come on board, sir.

00:03:55.534 --> 00:03:57.503
Hi, Noah Sanders the name.

00:03:57.536 --> 00:03:58.838
Sorry to hear
about your brother.

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.439
Maybe we could get
some Chinese food after this?

00:04:00.472 --> 00:04:01.440
- [clicks tongue]
- All right. All right.

00:04:01.473 --> 00:04:04.043
Okay, take it easy.

00:04:04.076 --> 00:04:05.645
Jeez, settle down, turbo.

